 the  title screen of skyward sword  okay okay jokes aside the award for best  title theme of any zelda game ever  has to be given to the soft piano melody  of ocarina of time  now i know some of you will write this  off as a choice made just because of  nostalgia  who knows maybe you're right but let me  put it this way  the legend of zelda's theme was iconic  and original  zelda 2 was adventurous a link to the  past was loud  aggressive heroic and link's awakening  was a remix of the original  when ocarina of time was announced as  the first 3d zelda game with all new  amazing graphics and gameplay and epic  music and  adult link players were expecting a  theme louder and bolder than ever before  to really seal the heroism in their  hearts  and ready them to fight the demon king  himself but when they plugged in that  cartridge  that wasn't what happened no there were  no trumpets  no drums no flashing lights or logo only  a fade in to a hillside silently  in the night and then they ride and a  piano begins to play an emotional tune  that completely blindsided every single  player watching  you hadn't noticed but the game had  already captured your heart  number one goes to the most emotional  title theme of all time  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  well there you have it my top 10 zelda  title themes of all time did you agree  with the list or was there a theme i  left out  let us know in the comments below and  please be sure to like this video if you  enjoyed and subscribe to help the  channel reach more fans just like you  and me huge thanks to mr croton for  helping out with this video  thanks again for having me dude it's  always a blast being able to just nerd  out about things like this  be sure to check out our other video  featuring yours truly live  right now over on his channel links will  be in the description below and another  massive thanks to all my supporters out  there  introducing the new faces of sam c and  jyn  1412. if you're in